{"id":"n67716-2-5","stage":2,"title":"여부 · 怀疑","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67716-2-5-1","ko":"이번 일은 자네에게 부탁을 좀 해도 되겠나?","zh":"这次的事，能麻烦你帮个忙吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일은","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자네에게","meaning":"你","explanation":"자네：你；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"자네","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70797","senseId":"1","lemma":"자네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부탁을","meaning":"拜托，请求，托付","explanation":"부탁：拜托，请求，托付；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"부탁","audio":"/audio/941d76ddd357e6c67c2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59301","senseId":"1","lemma":"부탁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해도","meaning":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되겠나?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带着某种计划和意图想要实现的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"aa7a1b1564db7cda","term":"자네","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3","entryId":"70797","definition":"(敬语)听者为朋友或晚辈时用来指称听者。","pronunciation":["자네"]},{"id":"941d76ddd357e6c6","term":"부탁","zh":"拜托，请求，托付","audio":"/audio/941d76ddd357e6c67c2e.mp3","entryId":"59301","definition":"请他人做某事或将某事委托给他人。","pronunciation":["부ː탁"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2d013cc5c43d38f846b6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67716-2-5-2","ko":"그야 여부가 있겠습니까.","zh":"那还用说，当然可以。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그야","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个；야：强调或突出前面的对象，也可加强对比、条件等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여부가","meaning":"怀疑，疑问","explanation":"여부：怀疑，疑问；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"여부","audio":"/audio/c97ad4a215b510923f6a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67716","senseId":"2","lemma":"여부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있겠습니까.","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"c97ad4a215b51092","term":"여부","zh":"怀疑，疑问","audio":"/audio/c97ad4a215b510923f6a.mp3","entryId":"67716","definition":"错误或怀疑的余地。","pronunciation":["여ː부"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ca9723cd334ccf3dfd93.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67716","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":81,"sequenceScore":2.2353,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那还用说，当然可以。","婚礼的准备工作都做完了吗？","这次的事，能麻烦你帮个忙吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那还用说，当然可以。","这次的事，能麻烦你帮个忙吗？","婚礼的准备工作都做完了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
